    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Rooney Auctioneers are delighted to present 8 Oakland Drive, Greystones, Limerick, V94 TFE4.\r\n\r\n8 Oakland Drive is an extra large 4 bed semi detached home in the prestigious development of Oakland Drive, just metres from the Ennis Road. With this excellent location comes close proximity to The Gaelic Grounds, Limerick Lawn Tennis Club, The Jetland Shopping Centre and a host of other amenities \r\n\r\nThe ground floor features an inviting hallway connecting to a duel aspect living room. The kitchen boasts two large windows overlooking the long back garden allowing light flood into the space. A secondary downstairs living room can be used as a home office or playroom. Upstairs, there are four large bedrooms, two bathrooms and a spacious hot-press adding space unseen elsewhere.\r\n\r\nGas fired central heating system  -  Built in 1962 - Not subject to a rent cap."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Kitchen - 6.13m x 3.39m\r\nLong kitchen with large windows to rear.\r\n\r\nLiving Room - 7.28m x 4.18\r\nExtra Long duel aspect living room with decorative fireplace.\r\n\r\nLiving Room 2 - 3.55m x 3.09m\r\nSecondary south facing living room.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 4.08m x 3.45m\r\nLarge double bedroom with built in storage.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 3.35m x 3.10m.\r\nSouth Facing double bedroom.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 3.49m x 2.72m\r\nSouth facing double bedroom.\r\n\r\nBedroom 4 - 3.02m x 2.35m\r\nSouth Facing double bedroom.\r\n\r\nBathroom 1 - 3.09m x 2.14m\r\nW.C., H.W.B, Electric Shower Cubical.\r\n\r\nBathroom 2 - 1.86m 1.74m\r\nW.C., H.W.B, Shower/bath unit.\r\n\r\nHot-Press - 2.09m x 1.26m."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Semi-Detached Home\r\nExtra Large Back Garden\r\nPrivate Driveway\r\nGas Fire Central Heating\r\nClose proximity to Limerick City Centre"
      },
